  "body": "Line on the page: 407,944.00 (DD 337,594 / ZM 59,250 / CF 11,100), not the 374,654.00 the SVB notices add up to (29 notices). Leapblock closed out our file on Feb 13 in #leapblock and gave what they received: 30 USD wires, 2023 104,868 (from 13 Sep, first one 33,290), 2024 232,726, 2025 62,950, 2026 7,400. 2024-2026 tie to the notices wire for wire; the 13 Sep 2023 wire of 33,290 has no Payment Processed notice. Per the counting doc their close-out beats the notices, so 33,290 is added to Domino Delights."
 },
